CriticalDampingCoefficientFormula

The Formula for the Critical Damping Coefficient

For a damped mass-spring system, the critical value for the damping coefficient is dependent on the mass and the spring constant.

c_{c} = 2 \sqrt{km}

where:

c_{c} [var. scal. CriticalDampingCoefficient] is the critical damping coefficient
m [var. scal. Mass] is the mass
k [var. scal. SpringConstant] is the spring constant

